        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Matte Black 48 Inch Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 48 Inch Rectangular Black Door Pull is available as a surface mounted pull, a thru-bolt mounted handle, or a back-to-back mounted pair of pulls (order two pulls), to fit any application. This Matte Black 48 Inch Door Handle will look stunningly modern in residential applications and it is also durable enough for commercial use as well. It is ADA compliant. The matte black finish is dark and beautiful.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTPULL48-size.gif?v=1704354572\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"48 Inch Rectangle Door Pull dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/matte-black-24-inch-rectangular-door-handle\"><b>2 Foot Rectangle Matte Black  Door Handle</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/matte-black-36-inch-rectangular-door-handle\"><b>3 Foot Rectangle Matte Black  Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 48\" Rectangle Stainless Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 48-1/16\" (1220 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 36\" (914 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\" (64 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\" (50 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rectangle Handle Diameter: 1-3/8\" x 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Post Diameter: 1\" Square</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/RTPULL48.pdf?v=1704262375\"><b>DWD-RTPULL48-622 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Matte Black 48 Inch Rectangular Door Handle",
                "description": "The 48 Inch Rectangular Black Door Pull is available as a surface mounted pull, a thru-bolt mounted handle, or a back-to-back mounted pair of pulls (order two pulls), to fit any application. This Matte Black 48 Inch Door Handle will look stunningly modern in residential applications and it is also durable enough for commercial use as well. It is ADA compliant. The matte black finish is dark and beautiful.",
